    "title": "Two hikers rescued from Flattop after injury chasing dropped phone in cold - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anthony Wright ,\n6 hours ago Two hikers were rescued from the Flattop area after one was injured chasing a dropped phone in freezing temperatures. The hikers had been out longer than expected in single-digit temperatures while descending toward the Glen Alps parking lot. One of them dropped a phone and went off trail to retrieve it, sustaining an injury in the process. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
